cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the claim store, please cite it as below."
title: "PD single-cell claim replication: a living, re-tested evidence base"
abstract: >-
  Published conclusions of human post-mortem brain Parkinson's disease single-cell studies, extracted as structured
  claims, re-tested donor-level in their own data and in every other harmonised dataset, rated for certainty, and
  served as a knowledge graph, an atlas and an MCP/REST server for people and AI systems.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Marco Salas"
    given-names: "Sergio"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sergiomarco25/pd-sc-claims"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Parkinson's disease
  - single-cell
  - replication
  - meta-analysis
  - knowledge graph
  - Model Context Protocol
